(6262820, 926661, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is the first image I click on, and something in my gut tells me it''s a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=54645" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">bspurgeon</a>...  The lighting here is so heroic, and yet, it is such an intimate moment, magical.  I feel that she is in a private cocoon, separate from the real world, and yet, projected upon a dreamy seascape, with softly swirling clouds.  Fabulous image.  Even it it turns out not to be Ben''s.<br/> <br/>Yup.  My pick for the blue.</td>', 'This is the first image I click on, and something in my gut tells me it''s a  bspurgeon...  The lighting here is so heroic, and yet, it is such an intimate moment, magical.  I feel that she is in a private cocoon, separate from the real world, and yet, projected upon a dreamy seascape, with softly swirling clouds.  Fabulous image.  Even it it turns out not to be Ben''s. Yup.  My pick for the blue.', '2010-12-28 16:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
