(6264490, 926651, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good idea with the low perspective. But the lighting on this shot is unflattering. We can only see a small part of the tree lights, and there are a lot of shadows. I would suggest trying to refine where the flash falls. You can block it with household items to make sure it doesn''t spill out to where it''s unwanted.</td>', 'Good idea with the low perspective. But the lighting on this shot is unflattering. We can only see a small part of the tree lights, and there are a lot of shadows. I would suggest trying to refine where the flash falls. You can block it with household items to make sure it doesn''t spill out to where it''s unwanted.', '2010-12-30 08:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
